  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-indigo pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Laser Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/db/Ben_10_Diamondhead_Vendetta.png/revision/latest?cb=20200328132825\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Ben 10 Diamondhead Vendetta\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/db/Ben_10_Diamondhead_Vendetta.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200328132825\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/db/Ben_10_Diamondhead_Vendetta.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200328132825 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/d/db/Ben_10_Diamondhead_Vendetta.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20200328132825 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Ben 10 Diamondhead Vendetta\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Ben_10_Diamondhead_Vendetta.png\" data-image-name=\"Ben 10 Diamondhead Vendetta.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Petrosapiens (Ben 10) like Diamondhead can absorb energy like lasers and harmlessly process them.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb laser.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb lasers and utilize them in some way</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Laser_Manipulation\" title=\"Laser Manipulation\">Laser Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Light_Absorption\" title=\"Light Absorption\">Light Absorption</a>. Not to be confused <a href=\"/wiki/Laser_Immunity\" title=\"Laser Immunity\">Laser Immunity</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLaser_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Laser Absorbance</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLaser_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb lasers, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLaser_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Laser_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Laser Manipulation\">Bio-Laser Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Enhanced_Condition\" title=\"Elemental Enhanced Condition\">Elemental Enhanced Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Laser_Generation\" title=\"Laser Generation\">Laser Generation</a>; by releasing absorbed lasers</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Laser_Empowerment\" title=\"Laser Empowerment\">Laser Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Absorption\" title=\"Light Absorption\">Light Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a> (limited to laser light powers)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLaser_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Laser_Manipulation\" title=\"Laser Manipulation\">Laser Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Absorption\" title=\"Light Absorption\">Light Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLaser_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLaser_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Conductoids (<i>Ben 10</i>)\n<ul><li>Feedback</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Crystalsapien\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Crystalsapien\">Crystalsapiens</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)\n<ul><li>Chromastone</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Petrosapien\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Petrosapien\">Petrosapiens</a> (<i>Ben 10</i>)\n<ul><li>Diamondhead</li></ul></li>\n<li>Fulmini (<i>Ben 10 Reboot</i>)\n<ul><li>Shock Rock</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Carl_Creel_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Carl Creel (Earth-616)\">Carl Creel/Absorbing Man</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260802092356\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 104/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 137/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.812      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    8.812      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:383632-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260802092356 and revision id 2788032. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
